to see here. Tigre sits on an island that was created by rivers and streams. After lunch, we are taking a vintage mahogany boat through the web of rivers. Be sure to keep an eye out for wildlife in the woods and along the riverbanks. The name Tigre comes from the Spanish word meaning jaguar - don't worry, you won't see any today!"}, {"time": "29500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn4le17ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\"></span>For those of you who have their bird books, there's a diverse assortment of bird species in Tigre. We are 32 kilometers outside of Buenos Aires, so it is peaceful enough for these birds to breed. You can see some nests if you look closely."}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le17ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le17ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "John in Argentina", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Day Trip", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations.", "type": "seconda